# Tape-to-Cloud — Free-Tool Inventory

Full catalog: `discovery/tape-to-cloud/free-tool-inventory.md`

## Critical storage correction

**MinIO Community Edition is archived (GitHub: April 25, 2026).** Self-hosted S3 default: **SeaweedFS** (`tape-vault`, `vtl-cloud`). Fallbacks: Garage (edge), RustFS (alpha + GUI). Migrate from MinIO with `rclone sync`.

## Loop-internal (improve the tool)

| Stage | Free tools |
|---|---|
| Quality | Ruff, mypy, pyright, interrogate, pip-audit |
| Secrets | gitleaks-action, TruffleHog |
| Workflows | actionlint, zizmor |
| Static analysis | CodeQL (public repos) |
| Release | release-please or git-cliff |
| Observability | OpenTelemetry SDK → SigNoz/GlitchTip self-host |
| Local CI | `act` (nektos/act) |
| Supply chain | step-security/harden-runner (audit egress) |

## Feature-coverage (deliver the 16 modules)

| Area | Default stack |
|---|---|
| Tape/VTL | `mt-st` + `stenc`; `mhvtl` dev/CI; Holo-VTL for new Ubuntu 24.04 |
| Backup parsers | `libratom` (MIT), `extract-msg` (GPLv3), `pst-utils`, `cvpysdk` (Commvault license) |
| Email migrate | `msgraph-sdk` + `azure-identity`, `imapclient`, Temporal for durable jobs |
| OCR | PaddleOCR prod, EasyOCR prototype, Tesseract fallback |
| Transcription | faster-whisper (NVIDIA), whisper.cpp (Apple), Distil-Whisper (speed) |
| Analytics | DuckDB + Polars + PyArrow |
| Orchestration | Temporal (`restore`, `email-migrate`); Prefect/Dagster (`audit`, `analytics`) |
| Hashing | SHA-256 chain-of-custody; BLAKE3 throughput/dedup only |
| CLI | typer + rich + textual + httpx + pydantic v2 |
| LLM | litellm + instructor + pydantic-evals + OpenLLMetry |

