awesome-selfhosted releases.atom, GitHub Topics (`tape`, `ltfs`, `pst`, `ocr`), libraries.io digest, per-repo `releases.atom`.

## Rules

1. Every new tool needs a **named fallback** (OCR: Paddle→Easy→Tesseract; storage: SeaweedFS→Garage→Ceph).
2. **Free tier only** at 1-person scale; Temporal Cloud is paid ($100/mo Essentials) — prefer self-host OSS.
3. Fact-check licenses before `uv add` (`libratom`=MIT, `extract-msg`=GPLv3, `cvpysdk`=Commvault).
